    "date": "2026-08-13",
    "last_updated": "2026-09-25",
    "excerpt": "Barukh shèAmar for Shabbat and festivals, in the Old Persian rite, as recorded in <a href=\"https://hebrewbooks.org/20923\">MS Adler 23 ENA</a> in the JTS Library. The Old Persian rite shows some fascinating unique linguistic features. The first thing that immediately strikes one is its tendency towards poetic extensions and doublings, even in texts (such as the Avot blessing) where most other rites are almost completely uniform. It also shows some nonstandard vocalizations that appear to be influenced by the Babylonian system of vocalization. In modern Persian communities the standard rite is a variation of the Sephardic rite used throught the Mizraḥi world, but this older rite with its unique facets deserves to be preserved as well. This Barukh shèAmar is an intricate rhyming acrostic chock full of Biblical references.",
    "content": "<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"font-size: 1.2em;\">\nBarukh shèAmar for Shabbat and festivals, in the Old Persian rite, as recorded in <a href=\"https://makor.primo.exlibrisgroup.com/discovery/delivery/01JTS_INST:01JTS/1268701570007706\">JTS MS 4522</a> (formerly shelfmark JTS MS Adler 23 ENA). The Old Persian rite shows some fascinating unique linguistic features. The first thing that immediately strikes one is its tendency towards poetic extensions and doublings, even in texts (such as the Avot blessing) where most other rites are almost completely uniform. It also shows some nonstandard vocalizations that appear to be influenced by the Babylonian system of vocalization. In modern Persian communities the standard rite is a variation of the Sephardic rite used throught the Mizraḥi world, but this older rite with its unique facets deserves to be preserved as well. This Barukh shèAmar is an intricate rhyming acrostic chock full of Biblical references.\n</div>\n<hr />\n<table style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" class=\"draggable toggleable-table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th id=\"x\" style=\"text-align: right;\">Source (Hebrew)</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Translation (English)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nבָּרוּךְ שֶׁאָמַר וְהָיָה הָעוֹלָם<br />\nבָּרוּךְ הוּא׃\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the One</span> who spoke and existence was!<br />\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">They</span>!\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">א</span>וֹמֵר וְעֹשֶׂה<br />\nבָּרוּךְ רְצוֹן־יְרֵאָ֥יו יַעֲשֶׂ֑ה׃ <span class=\"citation\">(תהלים קמה:יט)</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the Speaker and Doer</span>! <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span><br />\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the One</span> who will do the will of those who revere <span class=\"divine-referent\">Them</span>! <span class=\"citation\">(Psalms 145:19)</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">בּ</span>וֹרֵא בְּרֵאשִׁית<br />\nבָּרוּךְ מַגִּיד אַחֲרִית מֵרֵאשִׁית׃\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the Creator</span> of creation! <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span><br />\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the Foreteller</span> of the end from the start!<span class=\"footnote_referrer\"><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" onclick=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_1');\" onkeypress=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_1');\" ><sup id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_1\" class=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text\">[1]</sup></a><span id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_1\" class=\"footnote_tooltip\"> Find Isaiah 46:10&nbsp;</span></span><script type=\"text/javascript\"> jQuery('#footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_1').tooltip({ tip: '#footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_1', tipClass: 'footnote_tooltip', effect: 'fade', predelay: 0, fadeInSpeed: 200, delay: 400, fadeOutSpeed: 200, position: 'center right', relative: true, offset: [0, 0], });</script>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">גּ</span>וֹזֵר וּמְקַיֵּם נוֹרָא וְאָיֹם<br />\nבָּ֤ר֣וּךְ אֲדֹנָי֮ י֤וֹם ׀ י֥֫וֹם׃ <span class=\"citation\">(תהלים סח:כ)</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the Decreer and Fulfiller</span>, awesome and fearsome! <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span><br />\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the Master</span>, day by day! <span class=\"citation\">(Psalms 68:20)</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">דָּ</span>ג֖וּל מֵרְבָבָֽה <span class=\"citation\">(שיר השירים ה:ח)</span><br />\nבָּרוּךְ אֵל נַעֲרָץ וְנִקְדָשׁ בְּסוֹד קְדֹשִׁים רַבָּה׃\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the Bannered of Myriads</span>! <span class=\"citation\">(Song of Songs 5:8)</span> <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span><br />\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the Deity</span>, ennobled and sanctified in the counsel of the many holy!<span class=\"footnote_referrer\"><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" onclick=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_2');\" onkeypress=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_2');\" ><sup id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_2\" class=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text\">[2]</sup></a><span id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_2\" class=\"footnote_tooltip\"> Find Psalms 89:8&nbsp;</span></span><script type=\"text/javascript\"> jQuery('#footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_2').tooltip({ tip: '#footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_2', tipClass: 'footnote_tooltip', effect: 'fade', predelay: 0, fadeInSpeed: 200, delay: 400, fadeOutSpeed: 200, position: 'center right', relative: true, offset: [0, 0], });</script>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">הַ</span>מְּהֻלָּל בְּפִי כׇּל־נֶֽפֶשׁ<br />\nבָּרוּךְ וּבַיּוֹם֙ הַשְּׁבִיעִ֔י שָׁבַ֖ת וַיִּנָּפַֽשׁ׃ <span class=\"citation\">(שמות לא:יז)</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the Praised in the mouth of all breath</span>! <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span><br />\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the One</span> who on the seventh day rested and was refreshed! <span class=\"citation\">(Exodus 31:17)</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">וְ</span>אֵין עוֹד מִלְּבַדּוֹ<br />\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">וְ</span>אֶל־עֲבָדָיו הַנְּבִיאִים גָּלָה סוֹדוֹ׃\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">They</span>, and there is no other but <span class=\"divine-referent\">Them</span>!<span class=\"footnote_referrer\"><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" onclick=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_3');\" onkeypress=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_3');\" ><sup id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_3\" class=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text\">[3]</sup></a><span id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_3\" class=\"footnote_tooltip\"> Find Deuteronomy 4:35&nbsp;</span></span><script type=\"text/javascript\"> jQuery('#footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_3').tooltip({ tip: '#footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_3', tipClass: 'footnote_tooltip', effect: 'fade', predelay: 0, fadeInSpeed: 200, delay: 400, fadeOutSpeed: 200, position: 'center right', relative: true, offset: [0, 0], });</script> <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span><br />\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">They</span> who revealed <span class=\"divine-referent\">Their</span> secret to <span class=\"divine-referent\">Their</span> servants the prophets!<span class=\"footnote_referrer\"><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" onclick=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_4');\" onkeypress=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_4');\" ><sup id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_4\" class=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text\">[4]</sup></a><span id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_4\" class=\"footnote_tooltip\"> Find Amos 3:7&nbsp;</span></span><script type=\"text/javascript\"> jQuery('#footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_4').tooltip({ tip: '#footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_4', tipClass: 'footnote_tooltip', effect: 'fade', predelay: 0, fadeInSpeed: 200, delay: 400, fadeOutSpeed: 200, position: 'center right', relative: true, offset: [0, 0], });</script> <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">זַ</span>ן וּמְפַרְנֵס לַכֹּל<br />\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">זִ</span>כְרוֹ וּשְׁבָחוֹ תָּמִיד בְּפִי כֹּל׃\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the Feeder and Provider of all</span>! <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span><br />\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">They</span> whose moniker and praise is always in the mouth of all! <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">חַ</span>י לָעַד וְקַיָּם לָנֶֽצַח<br />\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">חַ</span>נּוּן אֲשֶׁר לוֹ הַגְּדֻלָּ֨ה וְהַגְּבוּרָ֤ה והַתִּפְאֶ֙רֶת֙ וְהַנֵּ֣צַח׃ <span class=\"citation\">(דברי הימים א׳ כט:יא)</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the One</span> <span class=\"divine-referent\">Living Eternal</span> and <span class=\"divine-referent\">Existing Forever</span>! <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span>  <br />\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the Gracious One</span> whose is greatness, power, splendor, and eternity! <span class=\"citation\">(I Chronicles 29:11)</span> <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">טְ</span>ה֤וֹר עֵינַ֙יִם֙ <span class=\"citation\">(חבקוק א:יג)</span><br />\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">טָ</span>ס וְדִבֵּר מִבֵּין כְּרוּבִים שְׁנַֽיִם׃\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the Pure-Sighted</span>! <span class=\"citation\">(Habakkuk 1:13)</span> <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span><br />\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the Flier</span> who spoke from between the two cherubim! <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">יָ</span>הּ מִסְתַּתֵּר בְּחֶבְיוֹן<br />\nבָּרוּךְ שׁוֹמֵֽעַ צַעֲקַת עַם עָנִי וְאֶבְיוֹן׃\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">Yah</span>, hidden in visions! <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span><br />\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the Hearer</span> of the cry of the poor and needy people!<span class=\"footnote_referrer\"><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" onclick=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_5');\" onkeypress=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_5');\" ><sup id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_5\" class=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text\">[5]</sup></a><span id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_5\" class=\"footnote_tooltip\"> The word people, עַם, Bis written in superscript in the manuscript.&nbsp;</span></span><script type=\"text/javascript\"> jQuery('#footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_5').tooltip({ tip: '#footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_5', tipClass: 'footnote_tooltip', effect: 'fade', predelay: 0, fadeInSpeed: 200, delay: 400, fadeOutSpeed: 200, position: 'center right', relative: true, offset: [0, 0], });</script>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">כְּ</span>בוֹדוֹ מָלֵא שָׁמַֽיִם וָאָֽרֶץ<br />\nבָּרוּךְ וְכָ֥ל בַּשָּׁלִ֖שׁ עֲפַ֣ר הָאָ֑רֶץ׃ <span class=\"citation\">(ישעיה מ:יב)</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the One</span> whose glory fills heaven and earth! <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span><br />\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the One</span> who measured the earth’s dust by thirds! <span class=\"citation\">(Isaiah 40:12)</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">לְ</span>בַדּוֹ שׁוֹכֵן עֲלִיָּתוֹ<br />\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">לֹ֥</span>א יִיעַ֖ף וְלֹ֣א יִיגָ֑ע אֵ֥ין חֵ֖קֶר לִתְבוּנָתֽוֹ׃ <span class=\"citation\">(ישעיה מ:כח)</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the Only Dweller in the Heights</span>! <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span><br />\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the Neither Tiring Nor Toiling One</span> with measureless understanding! <span class=\"citation\">(Isaiah 40:28)</span> <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">מַ</span>עֲבִיר אֲפֵלָה וּמֵבִיא אוֹרָה<br />\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">מְ</span>נַהֵג עַמּוֹ בֵּית יִשְׂרָאֵל בְּדֶֽרֶךְ יְשָׁרָה׃\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the Remover of darkness</span> and <span class=\"divine-referent\">Bringer of light</span>! <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span><br />\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the Leader</span> of <span class=\"divine-referent\">Their</span> people the house of Israel on a straight path! <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">נֶ֝</span>אְזָ֗ר בִּגְבוּרָֽה <span class=\"citation\">(תהלים סה:ז)</span><br />\nבָּרוּךְ שׁוֹכֵן סְתָרִים וְעִמֵּהּ שְׁרֵא וּנְהוֹרָה׃\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the Strength-Girt</span>! <span class=\"citation\">(Psalms 65:7)</span> <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span><br />\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the Dweller in Secrets</span>, with whom light dwells!<span class=\"footnote_referrer\"><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" onclick=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_6');\" onkeypress=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_6');\" ><sup id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_6\" class=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text\">[6]</sup></a><span id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_6\" class=\"footnote_tooltip\"> Find Daniel 2:22&nbsp;</span></span><script type=\"text/javascript\"> jQuery('#footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_6').tooltip({ tip: '#footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_6', tipClass: 'footnote_tooltip', effect: 'fade', predelay: 0, fadeInSpeed: 200, delay: 400, fadeOutSpeed: 200, position: 'center right', relative: true, offset: [0, 0], });</script>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">שָׂ</span>ם עִמּוֹ הַמְשֵׁל וָפַֽחַד<br />\nבָּרוּךְ אֲשֶׁר֙ לֹא־יִשָּׂ֣א פָנִ֔ים וְלֹ֥א יִקַּ֖ח שֹֽׁחַד׃ <span class=\"citation\">(דברים י:יז)</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the One</span> who sets with <span class=\"divine-referent\">Them</span> dominion and dread!<span class=\"footnote_referrer\"><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" onclick=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_7');\" onkeypress=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_7');\" ><sup id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_7\" class=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text\">[7]</sup></a><span id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_7\" class=\"footnote_tooltip\"> Find Job 25:2&nbsp;</span></span><script type=\"text/javascript\"> jQuery('#footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_7').tooltip({ tip: '#footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_7', tipClass: 'footnote_tooltip', effect: 'fade', predelay: 0, fadeInSpeed: 200, delay: 400, fadeOutSpeed: 200, position: 'center right', relative: true, offset: [0, 0], });</script> <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span><br />\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the One</span> who does not show bias or accept bribery! <span class=\"citation\">(Deuteronomy 10:17)</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">עֹ</span>שֶׂה בִּמְרוֹמָיו שָׁלוֹם<br />\nבָּרוּךְ לָרָחוֹק וְלַקָּרוֹב אָמַר שָׁלוֹם שָׁלוֹם׃\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the Maker on high</span> of peace!<span class=\"footnote_referrer\"><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" onclick=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_8');\" onkeypress=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_8');\" ><sup id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_8\" class=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text\">[8]</sup></a><span id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_8\" class=\"footnote_tooltip\"> Find Job 25:2&nbsp;</span></span><script type=\"text/javascript\"> jQuery('#footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_8').tooltip({ tip: '#footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_8', tipClass: 'footnote_tooltip', effect: 'fade', predelay: 0, fadeInSpeed: 200, delay: 400, fadeOutSpeed: 200, position: 'center right', relative: true, offset: [0, 0], });</script> <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span><br />\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the One</span> who said to the near and far, “Peace, peace!”<span class=\"footnote_referrer\"><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" onclick=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_9');\" onkeypress=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_9');\" ><sup id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_9\" class=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text\">[9]</sup></a><span id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_9\" class=\"footnote_tooltip\"> Find Isaiah 57:19&nbsp;</span></span><script type=\"text/javascript\"> jQuery('#footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_9').tooltip({ tip: '#footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_9', tipClass: 'footnote_tooltip', effect: 'fade', predelay: 0, fadeInSpeed: 200, delay: 400, fadeOutSpeed: 200, position: 'center right', relative: true, offset: [0, 0], });</script>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">פֹּ</span>עֵ֥ל יְ֝שׁוּע֗וֹת <span class=\"citation\">(תהלים ז:יב)</span><br />\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">צַ</span>דִּיק קֹרֵ֥א הַדֹּר֖וֹת׃ <span class=\"citation\">(ישעיה מא:ד)</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the Worker of Salvations</span>! <span class=\"citation\">(Psalms 7:12)</span> <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span><br />\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the righteous Caller of Generations</span>! <span class=\"citation\">(Isaiah 41:4)</span> <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">קָ</span>ד֧וֹשׁ ׀ קָד֛וֹשׁ קָד֖וֹשׁ אָיֹם וְנוֹרָא<br />\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">רַ</span>חוּם וְחַנּוּן וְעִמּוֹ גְּבוּרָה׃\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the holy, holy, holy</span><span class=\"footnote_referrer\"><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" onclick=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_10');\" onkeypress=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_10');\" ><sup id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_10\" class=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text\">[10]</sup></a><span id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_10\" class=\"footnote_tooltip\"> Isaiah 6:3&nbsp;</span></span><script type=\"text/javascript\"> jQuery('#footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_10').tooltip({ tip: '#footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_10', tipClass: 'footnote_tooltip', effect: 'fade', predelay: 0, fadeInSpeed: 200, delay: 400, fadeOutSpeed: 200, position: 'center right', relative: true, offset: [0, 0], });</script> <span class=\"divine-referent\">Fearsome and Awesome One</span>! <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span><br />\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the Compassionate and Gracious One</span> with whom is strength! <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">שַׁ</span>דַּי שֹׁכֵ֥ן עַד֙<br />\nבָּרוּךְ <span class=\"acrostic\">תְּ֝</span>הִלָּת֗וֹ עֹמֶ֥דֶת לָעַֽד׃ <span class=\"citation\">(תהלים קיא:י)</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the Surveyor</span>, who dwells beyond! <span class=\"citation\">(Isaiah 57:15)</span> <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span><br />\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">Their</span> praise, standing forever! <span class=\"citation\">(Psalms 111:10)</span> <span class=\"acrostic\">&nbsp;</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nבָּרוּךְ שֶׁאֵין לְפָנָיו<br />\nלֹא־עַוְלָה<br />\nוְלֹא־שִׁכְחָה<br />\nלֹא־כָּזָב<br />\nוְלֹא־מִרְמָה<br />\nלֹא־מַשּׂוֹא פָנִים<br />\nוְלֹא־מֶֽקַח שֹֽׁחַד<br />\nוְהַכֹּל שֶׁלּוֹ<br />\nוְהַכֹּל בְּמַאֲמָרוֹ׃\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nBlessed be <span class=\"divine-referent\">the One</span><br />\nwithout<span class=\"footnote_referrer\"><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" onclick=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_11');\" onkeypress=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_11');\" ><sup id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_11\" class=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text\">[11]</sup></a><span id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_11\" class=\"footnote_tooltip\"> Literally: &#8220;before whom there is no.&#8221; A reference to Pirkei Avot 4:22.&nbsp;</span></span><script type=\"text/javascript\"> jQuery('#footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_11').tooltip({ tip: '#footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_11', tipClass: 'footnote_tooltip', effect: 'fade', predelay: 0, fadeInSpeed: 200, delay: 400, fadeOutSpeed: 200, position: 'center right', relative: true, offset: [0, 0], });</script> injustice,<br />\nwithout forgetting,<br />\nwithout deceit,<br />\nwithout fraud,<br />\nwithout bias,<br />\nwithout bribery;<br />\nall is <span class=\"divine-referent\">Theirs</span><br />\nand all is by <span class=\"divine-referent\">Their</span> word!\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nבָּרוּךְ אַתָּה<br />\nיְהֹוָה אֱלֹהֵֽינוּ<br />\nמֶֽלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם<br />\nהָאֵל<br />\nהָאָב הָרַחְמָן<br />\nהַמֶּֽלֶךְ הַגָּדוֹל וְהַקָּדוֹשׁ<br />\nהַמְּהֻלָּל בְּפִי עַמּוֹ בֵּית יִשְׂרָאֵל<br />\nמְשֻׁבָּח וּמְפֹאָר וּמְרוֹמָם תָּמִיד<br />\nבִּלְשׁוֹן כׇּל־חֲסִידָיו<br />\nוְעַמּוֹ<br />\nוַעֲבָדָיו<br />\nבְּשִׁירֵי דָּוִד עַבְדְּךָ בֶּן יִשַׁי<br />\nנְהַלֲּלֶֽךָ יְהֹוָה אֱלֹהֵֽינוּ<br />\nבִּשְׁבָחוֹ וּבְשִׁירוֹ וּבְזִמְרוֹ<br />\nנוֹדֶֽךָ<br />\nנְשַׁבְּחֶֽךָ נְפָאֲרֶֽךָ נְרוֹמְמֶֽךָ<br />\nנַמְלִיכֶֽךָ נַקְדִישֶֽׁךָ נַעְרִיצֶֽךָ<br />\nנוֹדֶה לְפָנֶֽיךָ<br />\nנַזְכִּירָךְ וְנַזְכִּיר אֶת־שְׁמָךְ וְזִכְרָךְ עָלֵֽינוּ<br />\nמַלְכֵּֽנוּ<br />\nתָּמִיד יַֽחַד׃\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nBlessed are You,<br />\n<span class=\"divine-referent\">Cause</span> <span class=\"divine-referent\">our God</span>,<br />\n<span class=\"divine-referent\">Sovereign of existence</span>,<br />\n<span class=\"divine-referent\">the Deity</span>,<br />\n<span class=\"divine-referent\">Motherly Father</span>,<br />\n<span class=\"divine-referent\">the Sovereign</span> great and holy<br />\nand praised in the mouth of <span class=\"divine-referent\">Their</span> people the house of Israel,<br />\nlauded and glorified and exalted always<br />\nin the tongue of all <span class=\"divine-referent\">Their</span> pious ones<br />\nand <span class=\"divine-referent\">Their</span> people<br />\nand <span class=\"divine-referent\">Their</span> servants,<br />\nin the songs of David<span class=\"footnote_referrer\"><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" onclick=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_12');\" onkeypress=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_12');\" ><sup id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_12\" class=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text\">[12]</sup></a><span id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_12\" class=\"footnote_tooltip\"> The word “David” דָּוִד is written in superscript in the manuscript.&nbsp;</span></span><script type=\"text/javascript\"> jQuery('#footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_12').tooltip({ tip: '#footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_12', tipClass: 'footnote_tooltip', effect: 'fade', predelay: 0, fadeInSpeed: 200, delay: 400, fadeOutSpeed: 200, position: 'center right', relative: true, offset: [0, 0], });</script> Your servant, the son of Jesse,<br />\nwe will praise You, <span class=\"divine-referent\">Cause</span> <span class=\"divine-referent\">our God</span>;<br />\nby his laudation and his song and his hymn,<br />\nwe will acknowledge You,<br />\nlaud You, glorify You, exalt You,<br />\nenthrone You, sanctify You, ennoble You;<br />\nwe will thank before You<br />\nand recall You and Your <span class=\"divine-referent\">name</span> and moniker<span class=\"footnote_referrer\"><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" onclick=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_13');\" onkeypress=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_13');\" ><sup id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_13\" class=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text\">[13]</sup></a><span id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_13\" class=\"footnote_tooltip\"> In the manuscript the words את שמך “Your name” are written here and marked with erasure dots.&nbsp;</span></span><script type=\"text/javascript\"> jQuery('#footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_13').tooltip({ tip: '#footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_13', tipClass: 'footnote_tooltip', effect: 'fade', predelay: 0, fadeInSpeed: 200, delay: 400, fadeOutSpeed: 200, position: 'center right', relative: true, offset: [0, 0], });</script> over us,<br />\n<span class=\"divine-referent\">our Sovereign</span>,<br />\nalways together.\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nבָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְהֹוָה<br />\nמֶֽלֶךְ מְהֻלָּל בְּדִבְרֵי שִׁיר<br />\nוּבְתֻשְׁבָּחוֹת תָּמִיד<br />\nלְעוֹלָם וָעֶד׃\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nBlessed are You, <span class=\"divine-referent\">Cause</span>,<br />\n<span class=\"divine-referent\">Sovereign</span> praised in words of song<br />\nand in the laudations always<br />\nforever and ever.\n </div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr />\n<h3>Source(s)</h3>\n<p><span style=\"float: right;\"><div id=\"attachment_68761\" style=\"width: 260px\" class=\"wp-caption alignleft\"><a href=\"https://opensiddur.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/barukh-sheamar-jts-ms-4522-fol--18v.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-68761\" src=\"https://opensiddur.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/barukh-sheamar-jts-ms-4522-fol--18v-250x250.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\" class=\"size-thumbnail wp-image-68761\" /></a><p id=\"caption-attachment-68761\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">barukh sheamar (JTS MS 4522), fol. 18v</p></div></span> <span style=\"float: left;\"><div id=\"attachment_68762\" style=\"width: 260px\" class=\"wp-caption alignleft\"><a hre